{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","腾跃落箭"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","进入警戒状态，会在敌人释放终极技能时将其打断。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，战斗开始时进入“警戒”状态。当非召唤物敌军释放终极技能时，五月立即进入霸体状态，飞跃至其头顶向其发射一支禁魔箭，造成200% + 20% ATK伤害并打断其终极技能，使其失去700点能量，随后结束“警戒”和霸体状态。本技能无法打断首领敌人但造成的伤害提高400%。\n使用终极技能时，选择一名非召唤物敌军或者自身，进入“警戒状态”。选择自身释放时，将对所有非召唤物敌军进行“警戒”。选择一名非召唤物敌军释放时，将只对其进行“警戒”，但五月会在其处于不可选中状态超过3秒或被击败后，转而对所有敌人“警戒”。\n自动战斗时，只会选择自身释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":66,"end":72,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":62,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":107,"end":109,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","禁魔箭造成伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","禁魔箭造成伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","禁魔箭造成伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","禁魔箭造成伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","疾雨之舞"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成多次伤害，期间处于无敌状态。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","闪现至目标身旁，以神出鬼没的身姿对目标进行6次攻击，每次造成65% + 8% ATK伤害，期间处于无敌状态，随后返回自己此前的位置。若在释放本技能期间响应了“警戒”状态，则五月会在响应结束后继续完成剩余的攻击。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至70% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至75% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至80% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","羽翼渐丰"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","在战斗中持续成长，每次成长会提升自身攻击力，并使后续箭矢额外造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","五月可以在战斗中不断学习和积累经验。每当五月普通攻击或释放技能时，均会获得经验值，参与击败敌方英雄获得额外大量经验值。当经验值积累满后，五月便可获得一次成长，永久提高10%攻击力，并使自己接下来的4发普通攻击或者“疾雨之舞”的箭矢获得强化，额外附带目标3% + 0.6%最大生命值的真实伤害，最高不超过自身75% + 15%攻击力。成长带来的属性提升效果最多可以叠加4次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":128,"end":135,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":156,"end":162,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","强化箭矢额外附带目标4% + 0.6%最大生命值的真实伤害，最高不超过自身100% + 15%攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","强化箭矢额外附带目标5% + 0.6%最大生命值的真实伤害，最高不超过自身125% + 15%攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","强化箭矢额外附带目标6% + 0.6%最大生命值的真实伤害，最高不超过自身150% + 15%攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身穿透。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的穿透提升10点，且在“疾雨之舞”期间额外提升5点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的穿透提升13点，且在“疾雨之舞”期间额外提升6点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的穿透提升16点，且在“疾雨之舞”期间额外提升8点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","啜饮甘霖"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","获得友军增益效果时，立刻获得一次成长。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当自身获得一名友军施加的非永久属性提升效果时，立即获得一次成长，一场战斗每名友军最多只能触发一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次成长带来的攻击力提升效果提升至12%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次成长时，使得自身下一次“疾雨之舞”附带额外2段攻击。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次成长带来的攻击力提升效果提升至14%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","终极技能首次打断敌人使其失去的能量提升。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“腾跃落箭”首次打断敌人终极技能时，使敌人失去的能量提升至1000点。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","鸣鸢"]]}